  "title": "Kirby Problem 4.90",
  "statement": {
    "representation": "markdown-latex",
    "text": "Do the Chern numbers $c^{2}_{1}$ and $c_{2}$ of every closed, symplectic 4–manifold X that is not a ruled surface satisfy the following?\n\n(a) $c^{2}_{1} \\leq 3c_{2}$.\n\n(b) $c^{2}_{1} =3c_{2}$ >0 if and only if $X =\\mathbb{CP}^{2}$ or X is a complex ball quotient.\n\n(c) $c_{2} \\geq$ 0.",
